{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37240","headline":"春日经湖上友人别业 · 章谒","name":"春日经湖上友人别业","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"何处狂歌破积愁，携觞共下木兰舟。\n绿泉溅石银屏湿，黄鸟逢人玉笛休。\n天借烟霞装岛屿，春铺锦绣作汀洲。\n一年一电逡巡事，不合花前不醉游。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"章谒","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37240.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37240","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}